  "description": "FORZA Electric Tricycle FeaturesIt’s simple to get on and off this powerful, step-through, fat-tire electric trike. Our advanced hydraulic disc brakes provide the greatest stopping power with the least amount of effort. The all-terrain knobby tires are capable of handling any surface. It comes with a large rear metal basket for storage, making it a great alternative for both work and play. GOBIKE FORZA comes with an adjustable front suspension and a soft seat with a backrest for a more enjoyable ride.Built Solid, Sporty Design Up to 40 miles range with pedal assist, and 31 miles without pedal assist 500W (750W Peak) Motor with all terrain tires.We’ve selected a high grade aluminum alloy for our bike frames which reduces overall weight without sacrificing strength and toughness. LCD Display The backlit LCD display plays an important role for our bikes. Here, you will find your speed, power assist (PAS) level, battery level, and odometer. This multifunctional display is weather resistant and built to last. Speed Shifter We’ve designed our bikes to get you to your destination, no matter how difficult it is. The Shimano 7-speed shifter delivers smooth and reliable shifting performance that allows you to traverse all kinds of terrain. Choose the right gear and add pedal assist and you will blast your way up even the steepest hills. Motor Power The motor is the driving force! We’ve carefully paired the power of our lithium-ion batteries with the high-quality, brushless motors. We’ve equipped the FORZA have a 500W (750 W peak) watt front hub motor that delivers an amazing amount power when needed. Battery Batteries are the lifeblood of any electric bike. Therefore, all of our e-bikes are equipped with long lasting, lithium-ion batteries that enhance your riding experience. Our batteries are made for distance and reliability. Charging your battery is a breeze. You can easily charge the battery while it’s in the bike or you can charge it independently. Our batteries will fully charge within 4-6 hours making sure you get back out there on your new adventure. Rear Storage The FORZA is equipped with a large rear storage area. The insulated container closes with a zipper. From pizzas to ice cold beverages, what will you carry in it?",
